- ≥ 1.3× speed‑up (or ≥ 20 % energy reduction) on the three hottest kernels.  
- 100 % functional‑test pass after each patch.  
- CI end‑to‑end runtime ≤ 30 min for a 7‑kernel repo.  

**Risks & mitigations**

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| LLM produces non‑compilable code | Syntax‑only compile step before benchmarking; fallback to manual patch. |
| GPU drivers missing on CI runner | Provide a CPU‑only fallback mode; document how to attach a self‑hosted GPU runner. |
| Large codebase slows static analysis | Cache SQLite DB in GitHub Actions; limit analysis to changed files (`git diff`). |
| Secrets leakage | Store API keys in GitHub Secrets, never in repo. |

